{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026AmQMo8TBxz1793797478.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《金融時報》報道，中美俄三國元首將會在深圳APEC會議期間會晤。中方表示，同相關方保持著溝通。</p><p></p><p>外交部發言人毛寧表示：「中方就中俄美元首會晤同相關方保持著溝通，關於你的具體問題，我目前沒有可以提供的信息。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T13:45:52.520050+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T13:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:38:33.124944+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T13:38:33.124944+00:00","content_hash":"ffce6691564a99c1292975e153056fab94f45743f8becfa6b6cd809d70fdadf4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}